{
  "id": "04",
  "title": "Context",
  "content": "<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.12) 0%, rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.04) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.2); border-left: 4px solid #FFB800; padding: 32px; margin-bottom: 60px; border-radius: 4px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; top: -20px; right: -20px; opacity: 0.05; transform: rotate(15deg);\"><svg width=\"120\" height=\"120\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFB800\" stroke-width=\"1\"><path d=\"M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z\"/></svg></div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-heading); font-weight: 300;\">Photon's <strong>Context</strong> is a high-performance orchestration object that encapsulates the entire request-response lifecycle with near-zero allocation overhead.</p></div><h2>Architectural Core</h2><p>The Context object serves as the central nervous system of your application. Unlike traditional frameworks that recreate request artifacts, Photon utilizes advanced pooling to recycle context instances.</p><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; margin: 48px 0;\" class=\"bento-grid\"><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(255,184,0,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"> <div style=\"color: #FFB800; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">IDENTITY MATRIX</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">Inject and retrieve request-scoped dependencies (Auth, DB, Logging) with full TypeScript inference.</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(255,184,0,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"><div style=\"color: #FFB800; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 2v4M12 18v4M4.93 4.93l2.83 2.83M16.24 16.24l2.83 2.83M2 12h4M18 12h4M4.93 19.07l2.83-2.83M16.24 7.76l2.83-2.83\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">DEEP-RESET</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">Context Recycling prevents GC pressure by reusing allocated objects through a pre-dispatch reset protocol.</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(255,184,0,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"><div style=\"color: #FFB800; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">O(1) DISPATCH</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">Instant access to pre-parsed parameters via binary-compatible lookup tables using <code>FastContext</code>.</p></div></div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 4px solid #FFB800; padding: 24px; margin: 40px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900; color: #FFB800; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;\">// SYSTEM_LOG: CONTEXT_RESET_PROTOCOL</h4><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; font-style: italic; color: var(--text-heading); opacity: 0.9; border: none; padding: 0;\">Upon request completion, the <strong>Safe-Flush</strong> protocol clears the context internal Map without deallocating the underlying object, effectively eliminating per-request memory fragmentation.</p></div><h2>Request Access Strategy</h2><p>Access request data efficiently using the scoped helpers. Photon ensures zero unnecessary memory allocation for query strings and path segments.</p><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 24px; margin: 40px 0;\"><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 24px; border-radius: 4px;\"><h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; color: #D1D5DB; text-transform: uppercase;\">Path & Query</h4><pre style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background:transparent; font-size:12px;\"><code>// Extraction at the Speed of Light\nconst id = c.req.param('id')\nconst page = c.req.query('p')\nconst all = c.req.query()</code></pre></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 24px; border-radius: 4px;\"><h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; color: #D1D5DB; text-transform: uppercase;\">Modern Body Parsing</h4><pre style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background:transparent; font-size:12px;\"><code>// JIT Optimized Parsing\nconst json = await c.req.json()\nconst form = await c.req.parseBody()\nconst data = await c.req.formData()</code></pre></div></div><h2>Efficiency Visualization</h2><p>Comparing Garbage Collection (GC) pressure with and without <strong>Context Recycling</strong> in high-concurrency environments.</p><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; margin: 40px 0; border-radius: 4px;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 30px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFB800; margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: var(--font-technical);\"><span>PHOTON_CONTEXT_POOLING</span> <span>0% GC OVERHEAD</span></div><div style=\"height: 8px; background: rgba(255,184,0,0.1); width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"height: 100%; width: 2%; background: #FFB800; box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255,184,0,0.5);\"></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 30px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #6B7280; margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: var(--font-technical);\"><span>GENERIC_FRAMEWORK_ALLOCATION</span> <span>~12.4% GC DOWNTIME</span></div><div style=\"height: 8px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"height: 100%; width: 85%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\"></div></div></div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; font-family: var(--font-technical); border: none; padding: 0;\">// SAVINGS: NEAR-INFINITE SCALING FOR MICRO-SERVICES</p></div><h2>State Management</h2><p>Context variables provide a powerful shared state for middleware chains. Leverages type safety via global interface extension.</p><pre><code>// 1. Set State in Middleware\nc.set('user', authResult)\n\n// 2. Retrieve with Confidence\nconst user = c.get('user')\n\n// 3. Type Safety (types/context.d.ts)\ndeclare module '@gravito/core' {\n  interface GravitoVariables {\n    user: UserProfile\n  }\n}</code></pre><h2>Response Orchestration</h2><p>Chain helpers for optimized delivery. Photon automatically negotiates the fastest encoding (JSON/CBOR/Text) based on headers.</p><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 20px; margin: 40px 0;\"><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 24px; border-radius: 4px;\"><h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin: 0 0 12px 0;\">Atomic Responses</h3><p style=\"font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Direct response helpers for common MIME types.</p><pre style=\"font-size: 11px;\"><code>return c.json({ data })\nreturn c.text('OK')\nreturn c.html('&lt;div/&gt;')</code></pre></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 24px; border-radius: 4px;\"><h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin: 0 0 12px 0;\">Status Helpers</h3><p style=\"font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Semantic error helpers for better readability.</p><pre style=\"font-size: 11px;\"><code>return c.notFound()\nreturn c.forbidden()\nreturn c.unauthorized()</code></pre></div></div><div style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1), transparent); border-left: 4px solid #10B981; padding: 24px; margin-top: 60px; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; font-style: italic; border: none; padding: 0; color: var(--text-heading);\"><strong>Pro Tip:</strong> Use <code>c.forward()</code> to implement zero-copy reverse proxies. Photon will stream the incoming body directly to the upstream service without buffering in memory.</p></div>",
